<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Land declares 3.0 centavo cash div.</title>
<headline>Ayala Land declares 3.0 centavo cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine property firm Ayala Land Inc on Wednesday declared a 3.0 centavo cash dividend per share, payable to shareholders on record as of October 15, 1996 on November 29 1996.  </p>
<p>This is the second cash dividend for the year following the 3.0 centavo per share dividend paid on April 22. Ayala Land also declared a 50 percent stock divided on August 15.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
